WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:06.430
<i>Long ago, nine ships appeared in Uraga Bay.</i>

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.850
<i>These ships, which would later be known as 
the "Black Ships," carried foreign emissaries</i>

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.320
<i>who demanded that the 
shogunate open Japan to trade.</i>

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:18.720
<i>When the shogunate refused 
their unreasonable demands,</i>

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.180
<i>they began an indiscriminate attack on 
the port with their massive cannons.</i>

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:30.160
<i>Then, an Onigami rose to meet them.</i>

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.080
<i>Its name was Takemikazuchi.</i>

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.820
<i>It was piloted by a young man who had not 
even gone through the rite of adulthood.</i>

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:44.230
<i>He and Takemikazuchi destroyed 
the Black Ships in a single strike,</i>

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.550
<i>and peace returned to Edo.</i>

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.680
<i>That was 21 years ago.</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:04.660
The Shogun is to receive a new concubine 
who is not a lady of the inner palace.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:09.620
The Shogun's concubines are to be chosen 
from the Shogun's ladies in waiting!

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:12.540
My daughter's been waiting for years!

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.850
Yes, the Shogun must first discuss 
the matter with the three families.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:20.740
Above all, the Shogun is ill! 
Why appoint a new concubine?

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.560
What do you think, Chief Minister Ii?

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.060
There's nothing to worry about.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:31.420
Ill or not, this is our Shogun's wish.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.190
And he needs an heir, yes?

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.530
Right, Matsudaira?

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.030
Indeed.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:45.530
Excuse me.

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:52.220
Fool.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.960
<b>Shinsengumi 
Patrol Station</b>

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:58.040
<b>Episode 6
Shigeyoshi of the Rebellion, 
The Bloody Surrender of Edo Castle!</b>

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.680
Doesn't it seem weird to you?

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.050
Kon-chan, you're eating a lot.

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:06.310
So? I have to eat to keep my mind off it!

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:11.610
The Shogun was supposed to be sick, 
and he's suddenly taking a woman?

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:12.980
It doesn't make any sense.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:16.320
What is Ii planning?

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:27.030
<b>Loyalty</b>

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:21.290
Those geezers are gonna take 
over the country at this rate!

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.550
Why can't we just...

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.860
Shigeyoshi-sama told us not to do anything.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:27.040
Hii-chan is so serious.

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:29.140
Of course.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:35.340
Without Shigeyoshi-sama, 
people like us would have no way to live.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:40.590
But we're so sexy, we could seduce 
that decrepit fool in an instant.

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.890
Kondo-san, that won't do.

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:48.090
But look. You've got nice boobs, too.

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:49.890
Stop it, Kondo-san.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.310
Stop messing around.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.390
Whoa, there...

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.570
Ha! She really told you, Kon-chan!

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.820
You could never do it.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.150
What?

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.530
I could seduce somebody if I had to!

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:04.740
Just try!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.830
I could!

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:17.990
<b>Dai Shogun</b>

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:18.000
Great Revolution

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.060
Why must this be?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:34.360
I, Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi, have done 
everything I possibly could for the Shogun.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.930
Because I love our holy land,

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:40.710
and because I believed in the castle 
where the spirits of the holy dead dwell,

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.370
the beautiful nature around us, 
and the people who've been raised here.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.150
But...

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:51.080
Our country has changed.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:01.630
This castle is now a den of greedy monsters.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.170
All have abandoned their pride as samurai,

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:07.760
and lost themselves in greed and lust.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.140
Tell me.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:17.310
Why do you continue to let those 
monsters command the shogunate?

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.490
Shogun, your life is mine!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.960
You're a fool, Matsudaira.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:37.880
Imbecile. At this rate, the shogunate will 
be left behind by the rest of the world.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:39.390
Chief Minister...

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:44.860
Has the Shogun really decided 
to take such a concubine?

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.390
The times have changed.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.270
There's more to our job than 
the exclusion of foreigners.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:55.890
Does the Shogun believe we should think 
about opening the country to trade?

00:04:57.550 --> 00:05:01.280
He probably thinks that since he has 
no heir, now is the right time.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:06.480
The shogunate vassals who are already angry 
over the concubine won't stand for it.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.030
Especially Shigeyoshi...

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.740
Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi-kun...

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.100
I've done all I could for him,

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.290
and he still talks about 
"honor" and "loyalty."

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:21.580
But it's true that there are 
still many, like the Shinsengumi,

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:22.760
who believe in his power!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.380
His Onigami will not operate!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:31.480
And without an Onigami, 
he's just a bird in a cage.

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:32.990
He can't do anything.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:37.830
But the Hitotsubashi is a clan with 
the power of all three families,

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:41.600
and Shigeyoshi is a favorite of the Shogun!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.410
That was a long time ago.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:48.460
We don't need Takemikazuchi now.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:49.660
Right?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.750
Yes.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:54.340
Now all you have to do 
is give us the Onigami,

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:57.410
and the Armstrong Cannon is yours.

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:00.830
Everything's ready.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:07.470
It's a new type of cannon that can blast 
through a Puppet's armor in one shot.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.490
Is that the trade?

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:12.550
And then the Shogun takes his concubine...

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:13.830
Fool!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.260
You are an imbecile, Matsudaira.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:19.350
The concubine is already pregnant.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:22.480
You know what that means, right?

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:29.390
If a new heir is born, we can 
form even closer ties to them!

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.530
We don't need to fight other countries!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.370
Right, Verbeck-dono?

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:35.580
We've got a good friendship.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.670
Shigeyoshi-sama's Onigami...

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.670
What?!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.300
Takemikazuchi?

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:54.220
That bastard Ii is going to use it 
in a trade with another country.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.940
Shigeyoshi-sama doesn't 
know anything about it.

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.580
What do we do?

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:03.770
Even if it's true, there's 
nothing we can do right now.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.800
What are you saying, Hii-chan?

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:10.450
No one has seen that Onigami since 
it was sealed away 21 years ago.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.540
We don't even know where it is...

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:16.240
Then why don't we go beat up the 
old bastard until he tells us?

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:17.590
Wait.

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:19.960
We need a little more proof.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:23.440
The Shinsengumi exists to 
protect Shigeyoshi-sama.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:26.590
And Takemikazuchi is important 
to Shigeyoshi-sama.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.210
Soji...

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.800
If we're scared, we won't 
be able to protect anything!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:33.890
Wait, Soji!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.100
Oh, my...

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.220
Are you fighting?

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.260
The hell did you say?

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.440
Houkouin?

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:47.600
Without his Onigami, the former 
hero is just another man.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:51.990
I supported him because 
I thought he had potential.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.870
I guess I was wrong.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:57.450
You trying to pick a fight?

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.250
You Shinsengumi

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:04.580
should learn to behave.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:08.460
The Shinsengumi believes in 
Shigeyoshi-sama. That is all.

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:11.220
How admirable.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:16.880
But if the deal goes through, 
the Onigami will go overseas.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.760
And Ii will rule everything.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:24.180
Shigeyoshi-sama wouldn't 
overlook such a foolish plan.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.340
And even without the Onigami,

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:29.230
if he gives us the order, 
we'll kill all those old bastards.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.200
If you keep waiting for something like that,

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.630
you'll never do anything.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.220
What did you say?

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.240
What do you mean, "something like that"?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.990
Why do you suppose the ailing Shogun

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:47.790
would ignore the three families 
and take a new concubine?

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.070
Because he doesn't have an heir.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.680
So that's it...

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:59.640
Either way, you don't have time to waste.

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:08.570
They're going to use your Takemikazuchi 
in a trade with another country.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:12.280
Those cowardly old men are 
going to take over the country!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:16.540
The Shinsengumi is ready to 
kill them whenever necessary.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.040
Can you not feel it?

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:23.790
This country has become a wasteland 
ruled only by emptiness.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.870
Shigeyoshi-sama...

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:31.420
The holy castle of the gods, 
where the heroic spirits once slept,

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:34.810
has become a playground for 
monsters with rotted souls.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:39.430
The honor I believed in has passed 
beyond the horizons of oblivion.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.000
Then give us your order!

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:42.930
Shigeyoshi-sama!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.560
Can't you feel it?

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:52.780
The rage overflowing from 
the demon within my heart...

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:55.490
Shigeyoshi-sama!

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.950
I've been waiting for you.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.290
I'm sorry, Chief Minister Ii.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.250
No matter.

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:11.970
Get over here.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.880
Haven't seen you before.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.510
I-It's my first time serving you...

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.810
How delightful!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.790
Ii-sama...

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.350
Die!

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.510
Did Shigeyoshi send you?

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.360
Shigeyoshi-sama has nothing to do with this!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:40.250
But if a dog bites someone, 
it's his master's fault.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.240
You understand that, right?

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:44.830
Then what are you going to do?

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:47.580
You've come all the way here,

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.920
so we might as well have some fun.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.750
Your face is so pretty.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:13.560
Stop.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.640
What do you want?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.440
I'm taking her to the Shogun.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:19.470
Oh, the concubine?

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:20.820
We've been told.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:23.780
Who's there?

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.410
W-Wait!

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:36.250
What...

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:37.300
You...

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.390
Moon...

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.890
Get out here, everyone!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.000
You're under arrest!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:54.770
When you are stained crimson,

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:57.340
my demon will revive.

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:12.460
The hero who destroyed the 
Black Ships has fallen so far...

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:18.790
You must be mad, to slay 
the Shogun's concubine.

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:22.470
Everyone is talking about it.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.260
Have you been possessed by a monster?

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.350
For how long?

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.310
What are you talking about?

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:34.520
The Shogun can no longer bring 
a concubine into the inner palace.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.160
You saw it, then.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.940
It doesn't matter. 
You're going to die soon anyway.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.190
You've deceived us all.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:47.100
I forget how long ago 
it was that he got sick.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:52.160
But thanks to those of us who are 
still left, the nation is secure.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:56.750
You are a monster who deceives 
the holy shogunate and its people,

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.130
and mocks them all.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:03.140
Fool! That's what it means to rule a country.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:08.680
The Shogun is just a symbol 
that maintains the shogunate.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.100
Ii.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:11.350
What?

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.220
You rule the nation out of emptiness.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:15.600
You are an evil apparition.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:18.110
I'm an apparition?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:22.440
Then I'm the apparition who 
will haunt and kill you.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.610
We will never lose to an apparition.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.780
The Onigami will take back the country.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.200
The Onigami?

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:34.920
Come to think of it, the other demon you 
were having that woman investigate...

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:37.320
Keiichiro, was it?

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:41.250
I'm going to blow it 
apart with my new cannon!

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:47.590
I can feel the rage of the demon 
that resides within my heart.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:53.510
I'll send you to hell with 
that rage in your heart.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:56.460
Say hello to the Shogun in hell.

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:04.690
Chief Minister, we must call off the 
banquet to welcome the concubine.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:05.610
The vassals...

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.780
Why?

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:09.190
We'll hold the banquet as planned.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:14.160
But Shigeyoshi slew the concubine!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.310
Fool.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:17.730
You're an imbecile, Matsudaira.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.290
Haven't you heard the talk?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.500
Shigeyoshi is being put on trial 
for attempted assassination.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:25.380
Attempted?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:30.390
Indeed. The concubine 
survived at the last second.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.370
Then that corpse...

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.390
Whatever are you talking about?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:40.190
The concubine is heading towards 
the banquet with Fullbert-dono now!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.900
You can't mean there's another woman?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:50.660
All that's important is that everyone 
sees the Shogun take another concubine.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:53.110
So it doesn't matter who it is?

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.950
Is the shogun okay with that?

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.790
Of course.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.580
And he was very upset 
with what Shigeyoshi did.

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:07.050
In another time, Shigeyoshi might 
have become Shogun himself.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.380
But he can't, now that a 
demon has possessed him.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.720
Are you really going to execute him?

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:15.320
Of course,

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:18.930
and then I'll break up the 
Shinsengumi that he controlled.

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:22.350
But they're master Puppet pilots...

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.520
The age of the Puppets is over.

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:27.900
But the three families... Chief Minister!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.630
Fool! Don't touch me!

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:33.910
Being touched by a man disgusts me!

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:35.930
I'm sorry!

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.980
The banquet will begin soon!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:47.170
Why did Shigeyoshi-sama do 
this without telling us?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:49.010
We have to save him.

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:51.010
Wait, Kondo-san.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:54.880
Shut up! You're the one who 
said to believe in him.

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:55.930
Look at that.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:01.980
Who are you?

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:05.230
Don't you know we're the Shinsengumi?

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.380
Throw down your weapons and surrender.

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.940
The Shinsengumi are being dissolved.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.280
What?

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:15.040
Last night, Okita Soji was arrested

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.990
for attempting to assassinate the 
Chief Minister at Shigeyoshi's orders.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.160
What?

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:21.940
That moron!

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:32.010
Raise your heads.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.760
Yes, sir.

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:41.480
A banquet will be held tonight to 
celebrate the Shogun's new concubine.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:44.910
And we have more wonderful news:

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:49.230
the concubine is already pregnant 
with the Shogun's child.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:52.040
Now Edo's future is secured.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:17:01.040
But last night, a sad event occurred 
which casts a pall on our banquet.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:04.770
Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi, 
the leader of the three families,

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.070
tried to assassinate the concubine.

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:12.450
Fortunately, she survived, 
but we cannot forgive his actions.

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:16.180
Therefore, before the banquet begins,

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:22.130
I'd like you all to witness this 
demon-possessed man's execution.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:27.230
Bring forth the criminal!

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:47.460
I've obtained something 
wonderful from overseas.

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:03.380
Shigeyoshi-sama!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.480
Try begging for your life.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:18.210
Too scared to speak?

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.370
Then, let's begin.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:33.500
Listen to my words!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.960
What? What's he saying?

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:41.800
This castle is under the 
control of evil apparitions!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.470
Have you gone mad, Shigeyoshi?

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:51.540
It is the work of a few barbaric 
men who would hide the truth!

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:54.940
You're possessed by a demon! 
What are you talking about?

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:58.230
It's true that I swore 
a pledge to the Onigami

00:18:58.230 --> 00:19:01.700
to protect this holy land from 
the threat of foreign countries!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.920
This castle,

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.010
its people,

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:04.950
its nature...

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:09.920
I swore that I would even give my 
soul to the Onigami to protect them!

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:14.380
And it was all for the Shogun whom I served!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:18.010
Cease your prattling, fool!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.140
But these greedy monsters

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:25.010
are prepared to sell my Onigami and 
the country itself to foreigners!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.720
Wh-What proof do you have?

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:31.250
The shogunate itself is already empty!

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:35.690
The truth these evil apparitions 
have hidden is that...

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:40.490
The Shogun is already dead!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.050
The Shogun...

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:43.780
...is dead?

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.620
No...

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:49.450
There's not even a corpse in his chambers.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.750
That is the truth that Ii Naosuke has hidden!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.380
Lies! All lies!

00:19:55.690 --> 00:20:00.540
If my words are lies, 
the Onigami will remain silent.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:05.390
But if they are true, 
the Onigami will answer my call!

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:06.640
Silence!

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:09.060
I can feel it!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:12.270
The rage of the Onigami 
devouring the emptiness.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:18.030
The unseen rage of the people these 
evil apparitions mock with their lies!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.450
E-Enough talking!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:25.530
Die!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:29.200
Answer me, Takemikazuchi!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.630
What's going on?

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.010
Is this the rage of the Onigami?

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.190
You bastards!

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:04.740
The purpose of all this is 
to stain the moon crimson.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.700
Curse you, Shigeyoshi!

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:13.480
Die!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:18.540
Soji!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:20.630
Hey, Hii-chan.

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:30.540
I knew from the start what a 
black-hearted man like you would do.

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:39.520
You bastard...

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:42.150
You knew where the seal was this whole time!

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.790
Roar, demon!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.500
Now! Get them!

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:00.250
Kill them all!

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:18.520
The Shinsengumi are betraying us?

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:26.030
We're taking back our country, wimps.

00:22:29.170 --> 00:22:30.490
Moon,

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:33.950
I have given you the blood you wanted.

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:37.210
If you accept my loyalty, then answer me!

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:42.920
The time has come!

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:55.770
Awaken!

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:03.980
Takemikazuchi!

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:14.240
The blood of the monsters 
awakened the Takemikazuchi?

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:18.040
So that was the plan?

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:20.840
Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi...

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:24.330
You really are an interesting man.

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.070
Next time, Kiriko-san's 
childhood friend appears!

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:31.380
The three female samurai from 
the Shinsengumi show up, too?

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:33.380
These new rivals cause the 
boss's heart to waver.

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:35.930
No matter who comes, 
I won't lose to big boobs!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:37.990
Next time, another romantic rivalry 
to decide the fate of Japan!

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:40.220
<b>Next time: 
Ninja of Passion, 
the Bloody Shinsengumi!</b>

00:23:37.990 --> 00:23:39.010
See you there!
